&lt;h2 id="简介"&gt;简介&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 id="章节列表"&gt;章节列表&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/1" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;1. 楔子——嫦娥的秘密&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/2" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;2. 想揍俺？没那么容易！齐天大圣乖乖过来和高小姐一起吃俺老猪的肉棒，石猴也会发情？&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/3" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;3. 四圣试禅心——圣洁的菩萨们难道也会动凡心？观音，文殊，普贤，黎山老姆，四个一起上吧，俺老猪何惧！&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/4" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;4. 五庄观（上）——千载锁元，八戒化身导师拯救萝莉道童&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/5" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;5. 五庄观（下）——挽救人参果树，菩萨你别急，清风明月只是在帮老猪引出修为帮你救树&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/6" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;6. 猪八戒棒打白骨精，百花羞情迷波月洞&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/7" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;7. 红孩儿误入刀阵，猪悟能降服魔女&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/8" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;8. 女儿国王妾有情郎无意，淫贼猪妖收国师干女王&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/9" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;9. 琵琶洞里八戒逞凶遭罪，紫竹林中双女吸毒救险&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/10" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;10. 紫竹林中巧辨真假美猴王，火焰山上给老牛两顶绿帽（上）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/11" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;10. 紫竹林中巧辨真假美猴王，火焰山上给老牛两顶绿帽（下）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/12" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;11. 碧波潭龙女献身救父，朱紫国娘娘恪守贞洁&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/13" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;12. 七个蜘蛛精&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/14" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;13. 锦毛鼠&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/15" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;14. 入天竺圣僧中绣球，闹洞房八戒伏三美猪；天蓬施威收玉兔 嫦娥下界了前因&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/5ffccc86b4b24374acdcc970ec26885e/reader/16" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;15. 尾声：净坛使者遍历情缘终归色空　灵山受封难平心魔问观音渡&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>